/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 98 0 R
/E (The proposed solution is an AI-powered mobile application designed to identify and assess sports talent among students from diverse backgrounds. It uses smartphone video recordings, computer vision, and AI-based movement analysis to evaluate athletic performance without requiring expensive equipment or specialized facilities. The platform aims to provide accessible, transparent, and performance-based assessment opportunities, particularly for rural and economically disadvantaged students.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
